<title>THAILAND: Thai central bank schedule for Oct notes auction.</title>
<headline>Thai central bank schedule for Oct notes auction.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand said on Friday it had scheduled weekly auctions for a total of 12 billion baht ($480 million) in short-term central bank notes in October. Here is the auction schedule:</p>
<p>   Date     Tenor (Days)    Amount</p>
<p>				(million baht)</p>
<p>  4/10/96	28	     2,000</p>
<p>  4/10/96	91	     1,000</p>
<p>  4/10/96     183	     1,000</p>
<p> 11/10/96	28	     2,000</p>
<p> 11/10/96     364	     1,000</p>
<p> 18/10/96	28	     2,000</p>
<p> 18/10/96	91	     1,000</p>
<p> 25/10/96	28	     2,000</p>
<p>(US$1 = 25 baht)</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
